your installed nerd font.</div>\n39\t    </section>\n40\t\n41\t    <section class=\"step\">\n42\t      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>\n43\t        <div><h2>Theme &amp; display</h2><p>Overall look — style, theme, wrapping.</p></div>\n44\t      </div>\n45\t      <div id=\"display\" class=\"step-body\"></div>\n46\t    </section>\n47\t\n48\t    <section class=\"step\">\n49\t      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>\n50\t        <div><h2>Segments</h2><p>Per line: toggle, reorder, set options. Hover a name for what it shows. Budgets &amp; limits live with their segment.</p></div>\n51\t      </div>\n52\t      <div id=\"lines\" class=\"step-body\"></div>\n53\t    </section>\n54\t\n55\t    <section class=\"step\">\n56\t      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"num\">3</span>\n57\t        <div><h2>Custom data</h2><p>Extra segments appended after powerline (stored in the settings.json command).</p></div>\n58\t      </div>\n59\t      <div id=\"custom\" class=\"step-body\"></div>\n60\t    </section>\n61\t  </div>\n62\t\n63\t  <div id=\"tooltip\" class=\"tooltip\" hidden></div>\n64\t  <script src=\"/static/app.js\"></script>\n65\t</body>\n66\t</html>\n67\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd62c9ec-8b5a-4276-bac0-d2c82122134c","uuid":"b7e4c666-5dee-4b48-bc13-e68bcc59202a","timestamp":"2026-06-17T18:19:05.474Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/robertrhu/Projects/arhugula-v2/dashboard-design/output/configurator-elevation/target/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Powerline Statusline Configurator</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/style.css\" />\n  <script>window.__PWRL_TOKEN__ = \"__TOKEN__\";</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <span class=\"mark\">PWRL</span>\n      <span>Status<span class=\"sig\">line</span></span>\n      <span class=\"sub\">configurator</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <span id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></span>\n      <button id=\"reload\" class=\"btn ghost\" title=\"Discard unsaved changes and reload from disk\">Reload</button>\n      <button id=\"save\" class=\"btn primary\" title=\"Write changes to ~/.claude/claude-powerline.json and settings.json\">Save</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <section class=\"termwin\">\n      <div class=\"termbar\">\n        <span class=\"dots\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>\n        <span class=\"termtitle\">claude-powerline — live preview</span>\n        <label class=\"width\">\n          <input id=\"cols\" type=\"range\" min=\"50\" max=\"240\" step=\"5\" value=\"200\" />\n          <span class=\"cols-badge\"><span id=\"cols-val\">200</span> cols</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"preview\" class=\"preview\">…</div>\n      <div id=\"preview-err\" class=\"preview-err\"></div>\n      <div class=\"approx\">Approximate — rendered from sample session data with your installed nerd font.</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"num\">1</span>\n        <div><h2>Theme &amp; display</h2><p>Overall look — style, theme, wrapping.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"display\" class=\"step-body\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"num\">2</span>\n        <div><h2>Segments</h2><p>Per line: toggle, reorder, set options. Hover a name for what it shows. Budgets &amp; limits live with their segment.</p></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"lines\" class=\"step-body\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"step-head\"><span class=\"